                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Last week\u2019s SCOTUS decision upholding the state of South Carolina\u2019s determination Planned Parenthood does not qualify to receive Medicaid funds is a win for states like Nebraska, which moved to redirect federal funding from abortion providers in 2019. Ensuring taxpayer dollars go where they can best serve pregnant women and children in need is vitally important.\n\nRead my latest column on Life. https://t.co/uSTAa4fCV5",
