                "text": "In a @WaysandMeansGOP joint Health & Oversight Subcommittees hearing, I asked one of our witnesses, Dr. David Basel, how Medicare Advantage health plans can best be utilized to serve seniors and empower healthcare providers in rural areas. His role in the Avera Health system, which operates several rural hospitals in #NE03, gives him valuable perspectives on what works and doesn\u2019t work for Medicare Advantage in rural communities. See our exchange here.",
